\newlabel{fig:epsilon_summary}{{5}{8}{Performance versus the exploration rate used during training. Orange: average win rate over all 800 training rounds. Blue: frozen greedy evaluation over 200 new rounds. Error bars are one standard deviation across five seeds; connecting lines guide the eye between tested rates}{figure.caption.15}{}}
